{"answerable":true,"answer":"Per Cloudflare's Q3 2024 earnings release (published Nov 7, 2024), the unaudited condensed consolidated balance sheet is stated in thousands ('in thousands, except par value'), with columns for September 30, 2024 and December 31, 2023. As of September 30, 2024: total current assets were $2,163,878 thousand ($2,163.878 million); total current liabilities were $641,615 thousand ($641.615 million); the difference (current assets minus current liabilities) was $1,522,263 thousand ($1,522.263 million, i.e., working capital).","claims":[
